  "_comment": "Programs that make a line look like a shell command (legacy HiddenCharDetector.ShellCommands, docs/spec/detection-rules.md §6.1). Used by the trailing-newline check and by the 'is this line a command' exception of soft hyphens and invisible math operators. Matched case-insensitively against the first token (a trailing .exe is ignored); a line the command detector flags counts as a command too. Lowercase ASCII letters, digits and '-'.",
